{"s":[[null,1,[["g",[["Luau.png",320,[]]]],["p",["The Luau is a ",["l","节日","Festival"]," that takes place on the 11th of every ",["l","夏季","Summer"],". The player attends the Luau by entering ",["l","沙滩","The Beach"]," between 9am and 2pm. The beach cannot be entered before 9am. When the Luau ends, the player will be returned to ",["l","农场","The Farm"]," at 10pm."]],["p",["On the day of the Festival, every home and shop in Stardew Valley is \"locked\" and cannot be entered. This does not apply to the ",["l","绿洲","Oasis"],", which is open as normal."]],["p",["A central feature of the Luau is the communal potluck soup, made with ingredients added by ",["l","居民","villagers"],". The player may choose to add an ingredient to the soup, then the ",["l","州长","Governor"]," tastes and judges it. The soup-tasting begins by talking to ",["l","刘易斯","Mayor Lewis"]," and choosing \"yes, let's start,\" at the dialogue option."]],["p",["The reaction of the Governor at the soup tasting depends upon what item the player has added to it, if any. ",["l","友谊","Friendship"]," points with most villagers will also increase, decrease, or not change, depending on the item added to the soup. Friendships with ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", the ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", the player's ",["l","孩子","Children"],", and the ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"]," are never affected."]],["p",["The Luau ends automatically after the ",["l","州长","Governor"]," tastes the soup."]]]],["Shop",2,[["p",[["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"]," has a booth from which he sells the following items."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Price"]}],[[["f","Wall_Palm.png",30]],[["l","壁挂棕榈树","Wall Palm"]],["Can be placed inside your house."],["1,000g"]],[[["f","Jungle_Decal_1.png",30]," ",["f","Jungle_Decal_2.png",30]," ",["f","Jungle_Decal_3.png",30]," ",["f","Jungle_Decal_4.png",30]],[["l","丛林贴纸","Jungle Decal"]],["Can be placed inside your house."],["800g"]],[[["f","Ceiling_Leaves_1.png",36]," ",["f","Ceiling_Leaves_2.png",36]," ",["f","Ceiling_Leaves_3.png",36]],[["l","天花板垂叶","Ceiling Leaves"]],["Can be placed inside your house."],["400g"]],[[["f","Totem_Pole.png",30]],[["l","图腾雕像","Totem Pole"]],["Can be placed as decoration."],["1,000g"]],[[["f","Starfruit.png",36]],[["l","杨桃","Starfruit"]," (1)"],["An extremely juicy fruit that grows in hot, humid weather. Slightly sweet with a sour undertone."],["3,000g"]],[[["f","Plain_Torch.png",30]],[["l","普通火炬","Plain Torch"]],["Can be placed as decoration."],["700g"]]]]]],["Potluck",2,[["p",["When adding an item to the potluck soup, only edible, uncooked items are valid (although ",["l","生命药水","Life Elixir"]," and ",["l","蒜油","Oil of Garlic"]," are ",["l","打造","crafted"]," and not ",["l","烹饪","cooked"],", the game considers them \"cooked\" items, so they are not eligible. ",["l","魔法糖冰棍","Magic Rock Candy"]," and ",["l","椰林飘香","Piña Colada"]," are considered \"cooked\" items as well, so they are not eligible. ",["l","工作小食","Field Snack"]," and ",["l","虫肉块","Bug Steak"],", however, are eligible). Note that the game does not inform the player before the event that the \"potluck\" is a soup, nor that cooked or inedible items are not valid."]],["p",["Before the soup-tasting, ",["l","刘易斯","Mayor Lewis"]," states, \"I trust that you all put high-quality ingredients in the pot this year. We don't want the governor to regret his visit to the valley!\" At this point it is too late for the player to change the item already added to the soup."]],["p",["Note that item quality, base sell price, and edibility (healing effect) are the three determining factors of the Governor's reaction. ",["l","技能","Profession bonuses"]," that increase the sell price of items (such as ",["l","耕种","Rancher"],", ",["l","钓鱼","Angler"],", etc.) are not considered in the game's calculations."]],["p",["There are 7 possible outcomes depending on the item added to the soup."]],["p",["In a ",["l","合作","multiplayer"]," game, all players must add an item to the soup, or the \"Missing Something\" response will occur. Following that, the final result is determined by the worst item added."]]]],["Missing Something Response",3,[["q",["Hmmm... Well it's not bad, but it's missing something... Did everyone in town contribute an ingredient to the soup? I feel like it's missing someone's unique voice."],["Governor"]],["p",["The player neither earns nor loses ",["l","友谊","friendship"]," with the ",["l","居民","villagers"]," if no item is used."]]]],["Best Response",3,[["q",["Oh my... that's the best soup I've ever tasted!"],["Governor"]],["p",["The player earns 120 ",["l","友谊","friendship"]," points with the villagers if any of these items are used."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Quality"]},{"h":1,"v":["Eligible Items"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Normal"]},["Normal quality items are not eligible."]],[{"h":1,"v":["Silver"]},[["l","果酒","Ancient Fruit Wine"]," • ",["l","果酒","Apple Wine"]," • ",["l","果酒","Banana Wine"]," • ",["l","水滴鱼","Blobfish"]," • ",["l","绯红鱼","Crimsonfish"]," • ",["l","果酒","Crystal Fruit Wine"]," • ",["l","山羊奶酪","Goat Cheese"]," • ",["l","冰柱鱼","Ice Pip"]," • ",["l","大瓶羊奶","Large Goat Milk"]," • ",["l","岩浆鳗鱼","Lava Eel"]," • ",["l","传说之鱼","Legend"]," • ",["l","传说之鱼二代","Legend II"]," • ",["l","熔岩菇","Magma Cap"]," • ",["l","果酒","Mango Wine"]," • ",["l","蜜蜂酒","Mead"]," • ",["l","果酒","Melon Wine"]," • ",["l","果酒","Orange Wine"]," • ",["l","鸵鸟蛋","Ostrich Egg"]," • ",["l","淡啤酒","Pale Ale"]," • ",["l","果酒","Peach Wine"]," • ",["l","果酒","Pineapple Wine"]," • ",["l","果酒","Pomegranate Wine"]," • ",["l","果酒","Rhubarb Wine"]," • ",["l","熏鱼","Smoked Angler"]," • ",["l","熏鱼","Smoked Blobfish"]," • ",["l","熏鱼","Smoked Catfish"]," • ",["l","熏鱼","Smoked Crimsonfish"]," • ",["l","熏鱼","Smoked Glacierfish"]," • ",["l","熏鱼","Smoked Glacierfish Jr."]," • ",["l","熏鱼","Smoked Ice Pip"]," • ",["l","熏鱼","Smoked Lava Eel"]," • ",["l","熏鱼","Smoked Legend"]," • ",["l","熏鱼","Smoked Legend II"]," • ",["l","熏鱼","Smoked Midnight Carp"]," • ",[